  "question": {
    "text": "The standard Gibbs energy $\\left(\\Delta G^0\\right)$ for the following reaction is\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{A}(\\mathrm{s})+\\mathrm{B}^{2+}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\rightarrow \\mathrm{A}^{2+}(\\mathrm{aq})+\\mathrm{B}(\\mathrm{s}), \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}=10^{12} \\mathrm{at} \\\\ & 25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}\\end{aligned}$\n$\\left(\\mathrm{K}_c=\\right.$ equilibrium constant $)$"
  },
  "options": [
